The TypePHP GUI framework (typephp-gui) is licensed under the MIT License.

Parts of this directory are derived from tinyjsapp (https://github.com/tarwin/tinyjsapp),
Copyright (c) 2026 Tarwin Stroh-Spijer, also released under the MIT License.
tinyjsapp is a desktop GUI toolkit; we have vendored and fused its native host into
this project so the GUI implementation is owned in-tree and no longer depends on a
separate tinyjsapp checkout or patch-based integration.

