Derived / vendored files in this tree (respect their upstream MIT terms):

  gui/host/src/launcher-win.cc    derived from tinyjsapp native/launcher-win.cc
                                  (v0.42.0) with the --typephp backend-spawn
                                  feature merged in-tree.
  gui/host/src/launcher-linux.cc  vendored from tinyjsapp (pristine).
  gui/host/src/launcher-macos.cc  vendored from tinyjsapp (pristine).
  gui/runtime/tiny.js             vendored from tinyjsapp runtime/tiny.js
                                  (the window.tiny client API surface).
  gui/host/include/webview.h      vendored from tinyjsapp native/include/webview.h
                                  (the webview/webview C++ wrapper).
  gui/host/include/WebView2.h     vendored (Microsoft WebView2 SDK header).
  gui/host/include/miniaudio.h    vendored (miniaudio single-header library).

Originated in this project (MIT, yangweijie/typephp-gui):

  gui/php/src/Tiny/Gui/*          the PHP-native protocol framework (the fusion's
                                  innovation: a clean, extensible CALL/RET layer
                                  replacing tinyjsapp's JS bridge.js).
  gui/bin/tgui                    the dev/build/publish CLI replacing tinyjsapp's
                                  patched cli.js.
  shim/backend_shell.cpp          the C++ stdio<->IPC proxy (unchanged in role).
